.IX Title "Lucy::Search::SortRule 3pm"
.TH Lucy::Search::SortRule 3pm 2026-09-16 "perl v5.40.1" "User Contributed Perl Documentation"
.\" For nroff, turn off justification.  Always turn off hyphenation; it makes
.\" way too many mistakes in technical documents.
.if n .ad l
.nh
.SH NAME
Lucy::Search::SortRule \- Element of a SortSpec.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.IX Header "SYNOPSIS"
.Vb 6
\&    my $sort_spec = Lucy::Search::SortSpec\->new(
\&        rules => [
\&            Lucy::Search::SortRule\->new( field => \*(Aqdate\*(Aq ),
\&            Lucy::Search::SortRule\->new( type  => \*(Aqdoc_id\*(Aq ),
\&        ],
\&    );
.Ve
.SH DESCRIPTION
.IX Header "DESCRIPTION"
SortRules are the building blocks used to assemble
SortSpecs; each SortRule defines a single
level of sorting.  For example, sorting first by “category” then by score
requires a SortSpec with two SortRule elements.
.SH CONSTRUCTORS
.IX Header "CONSTRUCTORS"
.SS new
.IX Subsection "new"
.Vb 7
\&    my $by_title   = Lucy::Search::SortRule\->new( field => \*(Aqtitle\*(Aq );
\&    my $by_score   = Lucy::Search::SortRule\->new( type  => \*(Aqscore\*(Aq );
\&    my $by_doc_id  = Lucy::Search::SortRule\->new( type  => \*(Aqdoc_id\*(Aq );
\&    my $reverse_date = Lucy::Search::SortRule\->new(
\&        field   => \*(Aqdate\*(Aq,
\&        reverse => 1,
\&    );
.Ve
.PP
Create a new SortRule.
.IP \(bu 4
\&\fBtype\fR \- Indicate whether to sort by score, field, etc.  (The
default is to sort by a field.)
.IP \(bu 4
\&\fBfield\fR \- The name of a \f(CW\*(C`sortable\*(C'\fR field.
.IP \(bu 4
\&\fBreverse\fR \- If true, reverse the order of the sort for this rule.
.SH METHODS
.IX Header "METHODS"
.SS get_field
.IX Subsection "get_field"
.Vb 1
\&    my $string = $sort_rule\->get_field();
.Ve
.PP
Accessor for “field” member.
.SS get_type
.IX Subsection "get_type"
.Vb 1
\&    my $int = $sort_rule\->get_type();
.Ve
.PP
Accessor for “type” member.
.SS get_reverse
.IX Subsection "get_reverse"
.Vb 1
\&    my $bool = $sort_rule\->get_reverse();
.Ve
.PP
Accessor for “reverse” member.
.SH INHERITANCE
.IX Header "INHERITANCE"
Lucy::Search::SortRule isa Clownfish::Obj.
